Street Food In Myeongdong","city":"seoul","category":"food","neighbourhood":"Myeongdong","neighbourhoodSlug":"myeongdong","priceRange":"₩","nearestMetro":"Myeongdong (Line 4)","openingHours":"11 AM – 10 PM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498654896293-37aacf113fd9?w=1200&q=80","summary":"Tteokbokki, hotteok, tornado potatoes — everything you need to eat on Myeongdong's food streets.","intro":"Myeongdong's main streets transform into an open-air food market every afternoon. Vendors line both sides selling everything from freshly grilled skewers to towering soft-serve ice cream. Come hungry.","venues":[{"name":"Myeongdong Kyoja","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590301157890-4810ed352733?w=600&q=80","description":"A Myeongdong institution serving handmade kalguksu (knife-cut noodles) since 1966. The broth is rich and deeply savoury.","address":"29 Myeongdong 10-gil, Jung-gu","tip":"There's always a queue but it moves fast. The mandu (dumplings) are a must-order alongside the noodles.","priceLevel":"₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-bars-hongdae","cafes-gangnam"],"tags":["Street Food","Budget","Must Try"],"authorSlug":"mina-park","updatedDate":"2026-02-28","contentType":"guide"}}],["$","$L10","cafes-gangnam",{"guide":{"slug":"cafes-gangnam","title":"Best Cafes In Gangnam","city":"seoul","category":"food","neighbourhood":"Gangnam","neighbourhoodSlug":"gangnam","priceRange":"₩₩","nearestMetro":"Gangnam (Line 2)","openingHours":"9 AM – 10 PM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559305616-3f99cd43e353?w=1200&q=80","summary":"Design-forward coffee shops and hidden gems south of the river.","intro":"Gangnam's cafe scene is all about aesthetics and quality. Multi-storey minimalist spaces, rooftop gardens, and some of Seoul's best specialty coffee — these are the ones worth crossing the river for.","venues":[{"name":"Fritz Coffee","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?w=600&q=80","description":"A beloved Seoul roastery with a cosy industrial interior and pastries baked fresh on-site. Their hand-drip coffee is consistently excellent.","address":"17 Dosan-daero 15-gil, Gangnam-gu","tip":"Try the einspänner — their version with house-made whipped cream is the best in Seoul.","priceLevel":"₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-street-food-myeongdong"],"tags":["Coffee","Design","Brunch"],"authorSlug":"mina-park","updatedDate":"2026-03-05","contentType":"guide"}}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6","children":"Venues"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/venues/fritz-coffee","className":"group flex gap-3 sm:gap-4 p-3 rounded-xl bg-card transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-secondary/50","style":{"boxShadow":"var(--shadow-card)"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0","children":["$","$L11",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?w=1200&q=80","alt":"Fritz Coffee","width":96,"height":96,"className":"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105","loading":"lazy"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 min-w-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground truncate","children":"Fritz Coffee"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-primary font-medium mt-0.5 capitalize","children":"cafe"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"A beloved Seoul roastery with a cosy industrial interior and pastries baked fresh on-site."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground","children":"₩₩"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"